    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47871" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰνᾰτήφορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>death-bringing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					369
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίοδος θ</span>. cycle
				<i>of mortality</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				617d
			</span></i>; of hurts or accidents, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				48
			</span></i>; of a surgical operation, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.17.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζα ἐν Αἰθιοπία</span>, of
			arrow-poison, <i>Acokanthera Schimperi</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.15.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					672a36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένεθλα . . θ. κεῖται</span>
			<i>causing death by contagion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				181
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαι μεταβολαὶ πολιτειῶν
			θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαρτία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					18.22
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκαι</span>
			<i>capital</i> trials, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Not.Arch.</u>
				4.19
			</span></i> (Cyrene, Aug.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					4.12.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστάσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					225.7
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως, νοσεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.148S.
				</span></i>
			: neut. sg. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπλήγη οὐχὶ -φόρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					27.9
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φόρον ᾄδειν</span> to sing
				<i>a death song,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.186
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>).</div>
